<p class="ph-ey">A Workshop</p>
<h1>The Well Within</h1>
<p class="ph-lead">A 90-minute live online workshop on the journey to self love &mdash; because the love you were meant to nurture was never for anyone else but you.</p>
</div>
<section class="content"><div class="ci">

<p>I hold a simple philosophy: <em>we come from love, we return to love, and our work
on this earthly journey is to nurture a path of love.</em> I spent years believing that
meant loving everyone harder &mdash; and I exhausted myself trying. The puzzle finally
unlocked when I understood the love I was meant to nurture was my own. Because once
you learn to love yourself, your well &mdash; the place you dip into for energy and
vitality &mdash; resides <em>within you</em>. And once you learn to tend your own garden,
you never forget how.</p>

<p>My road to that understanding took decades, with plenty of scratches and some deep
wounds. This workshop exists because there is a gentler way through &mdash; and I would
be honored to walk it with you.</p>

<h2>What we'll do together</h2>
<div class="walk-about" style="border-top:none;padding-top:0">
<p><strong>Arrive & set down the load.</strong> A calm beginning &mdash; no introductions
you don't want to make, no sharing you don't choose.</p>
<p><strong>Find your well.</strong> Where do you currently go for energy and worth?
Gentle journaling to notice whose wells you've been dipping into &mdash; and what it
has cost you.</p>
<p><strong>Learn the tending practices.</strong> Simple, evidence-supported ways to
refill from within &mdash; self-compassion you can actually feel, the gentle no,
and the daily practices that make it stick.</p>
<p><strong>Name your gift.</strong> The thing that lives inside you waiting to be
expressed was given to you on purpose. We'll help you say its name out loud.</p>
<p><strong>Meet yourself in the mirror.</strong> The workshop ends with the oldest,
bravest practice there is: you, a hand mirror, and five words &mdash;
<em>&ldquo;I love you, ______.&rdquo;</em> Your own name in the blank. We'll build the
runway so the landing is soft &mdash; and you'll leave with a 30-day practice to
make it yours for good.</p>
</div>

